<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dark Knight Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Dark Knights' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>).
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to
Armor Soft Leather       0   50%
Consider                 0   90%
Rescue                   0   100%
Shield                   0   100%
Diagnostics              1   70%
Bash                     3   80%
First Aid                3   50%
Turn Undead              5   70%
Armor Hard Leather       7   75%
Leadership              12   100%
Armor Chain             15   100%
Armor Plate             20   100%
Taunt                   30   100%
Defend                  40   100%
</pre>
